                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e1d2e60-22e0-30f6-b0d8-e624178af746",
                        "entry_id": "501a46a9-6487-33a0-a646-738ae3346f49",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hercules; Herculean"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b277d1c0-fc96-4158-981a-c512236c4321",
                                "sense_id": "6e1d2e60-22e0-30f6-b0d8-e624178af746",
                                "text": "А са́м-то Алекса́ндр Васи́льевич ви́да и сложе́ния был совсе́м не геркуле́сового — худ, ро́стом не вели́к, го́лосом не силён, а вот насто́лько был лих да уда́л, что Елизаве́та восхити́лась.",
                                "translation": "And Alexander Vasilievich himself in looks and form was not of a Herculean type at all - thin, of a short stature, his voice wasn't strong, but he was so daring and skillful that Yelizaveta admired (him).",
                                "english": "And Alexander Vasilievich himself in looks and form was not of a Herculean type at all - thin, of a short stature, his voice wasn't strong, but he was so daring and skillful that Yelizaveta admired (him)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18de4df9-5adf-3e3b-ae5f-92eac8b434c4",
                        "entry_id": "501a46a9-6487-33a0-a646-738ae3346f49",
                        "glosses": [
                            "oatmeal"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "75dd967c-9fd8-49a2-843c-ebdc7d9e70e5",
                                "sense_id": "18de4df9-5adf-3e3b-ae5f-92eac8b434c4",
                                "text": "Хозя́йка говори́т, что ва́рит геркуле́совую ка́шу. Стра́нно, кастрю́ли на плите́ нет. Ну хорошо́, пусть ва́рит. Она́ второ́й раз говори́т, что гото́вит ка́шу. Не ви́жу, хорошо́, пусть гото́вит.",
                                "translation": "The hostess says she is cooking an oatmeal porridge. Strange, there is no pot on the stove. Well, let her cook. It's the second time she says she is cooking some porridge. I don't see, well, let her cook.",
                                "english": "The hostess says she is cooking an oatmeal porridge. Strange, there is no pot on the stove. Well, let her cook. It's the second time she says she is cooking some porridge. I don't see, well, let her cook."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
